      "message": "feat(post): grblHAL post processor and generic 3-axis machine\n\nRegisters grblhal.cps as the \"grblHAL\" built-in post and\ngrblhal-3axis.mch as the \"grblHAL 3-axis\" library machine. Conformance\ngoldens under golden/nc/grblhal/ plus synth_grblhal.nc; tapping is\nrefused there by name. A new grblhal_post suite pins the program shape,\nthe lone T M6 after the Z lift, dwell seconds, the tap refusal, safe Z\nstated/unstated and inch output. The cross-post tests (comment escape,\ncontrol and wear comp, tilt, inverted axis, after-op, coolant, machine\nlibrary) now include grblHAL.\n\nFixes #710\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
